
# Changelog

## 2026.11.09

### Added

- Designed a counter component
- Designed a music playlist component
- Designed a shopping cart component

## 2026.11.10

### Added

- Designed a proof of concept for the ShoppingCart component

### Updated

- Changed the design to use a Map to store items and their quantities

## 2026.11.11

### Added

- Designed kernel and enhanced interfaces for the ShoppingCart component
- Created an Item class to represent the price and quantity of an item
- Designed an abstract class for the ShoppingCart component
- Designed the kernel implementation for the ShoppingCart component
- Created two examples demonstrating practical uses of the ShoppingCart component
- Created test cases for the methods of the ShoppingCart component

### Changed

- Decided that the add and remove methods would only add or remove one occurrence of an item
- Changed the removeItem method to take only one parameter (item)
